      "source_text": "她的身边放着一个大行李箱……\n难道说，她一回国就直接跑来了这里吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9c435727017eb26671f4250ec781e8b67188306b9e69ef6d06497389ea9503d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
