    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ed11070b3b58e70dbfdae00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想在那里，将春天绽放的特别的菊花，\n编入花束之中——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "45c2f86fa8a74c8e070a879beed1be78635e177db25ab48e6f1624e256d6ca5e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
