    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61ea6362a5c26d242b072430",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（可即便如此，他还是说着\n『如果你有什么想法的话』，\n什么也没多问，就爽快地送我出门了——）",
      "source_fingerprint": "714213948845baa914988a88e2083b46a2a31fb2ab80054773210c4a5c6b9dee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
