    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:228e0351bc2ec926a514574b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我清楚，那对我来说是一道高耸的壁垒。\nGⅠ赛事中最长的3200米距离——",
      "source_fingerprint": "42aabc83f6b9d17aa7d9602582dddda2ec153ba97c17d285a54986ab03d07c81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c19695560470306cdd0b0726",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9300b8698e72d40698d8d6af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在后冠赛马娘中，只有一人曾经获胜过。\n近年来，甚至连能跑进前三名的人都没有。",
      "source_fingerprint": "411878d3b21ca75bb4c056dc64971e840ac3da8568008f4d368e221f11a41961",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:710cc57d46e3c1e5d41fb6e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eedc092e98be3b4bf3203fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "本来，这和之前我主战的赛场，\n在距离上就完全不是一个级别的——就算我的耐力\n还不错，可能也会非常吃力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d7dcf5dad7684c7aba84da225a76a9e6edc9be75270f7078fc4bf1a0a0b0436",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f38c46724b418de41df03ff7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
