      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24f1c4bcbf84338f797e8a32",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "机伶金花",
      "source_fingerprint": "955cd4363878ef381a312628deed024641cd3a750624558cd2f55accb62d0a66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d19f08b717c4853454efede",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为我觉得——如果是我，一定能做到……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef68b6985cbcf23f9ab2d655dbbf9c653d6e3ce79012ec1bb9ff1dd6227f5bbe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c044de7225a124e4cf618d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之前我只听说，她去了智利登山。\n至于她在那里看到了什么、\n感受到了什么，我一无所知。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0152ac0445f736df0eec750ad3970f17611068e2ce4cdd0856fa88e1ebdb3bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:429109241740266e48c4f02b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是——我知道，她借此\n获得了一份自信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47bfcb00e5fc44bde0daff9fdb523ddcb8403e5f4802815cdadf199e156364dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fb73456efb2c01ec5a9ab24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（『天皇赏（春）』吗……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc1ff3018a0e8e699f4db39e3b3dd90441b9e77482c3a1076a9c554ddc425d16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e259d47cde2ff1f1c2ea13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "究竟是什么驱使她做到了这一步——\n难道说，她也对自己至今为止走过的轨迹，\n感到不安了吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "191fa5faa23f1d6ff1ba7c0150e6cf94da1606480e2a6537ab800b09c649cd0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38e95452a1f4934ef0bd7d0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我知道了。那我们就去挑战一下吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae06821c220767f3a0d79816ed05550d396a6dcdec48c2b7a9ee9397f56ce793",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1134/storytimeline_501134117.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3bf158f97f883f47f1bfcbd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我咽下心中的不安，凝视着她的眼睛。\n即便只是做做样子，\n我也不想让她觉得我是一个没用的训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "778bd6b043ec243674bd621f69149ad129689086f9fb27fd5e7fcf4fc9ea1674",
